{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stack fast. Crash harder. Get certified.</strong><br>Forklift Certified: Stacked &amp; Loaded is a chaotic 4-player couch co-op party game where you and your crew take on the ultimate warehouse challenge. Load crates, dodge disasters, and try not to trip over the inventory\u2014or each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together (or not) through <strong>stacks of levels</strong> escalating in logistical madness, from calm tutorial bays to frantic arenas full of crates, conveyor belts, and unpredictable warehouse hazards. Whether you're in the same room or using <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong>, teamwork is optional\u2014fun is guaranteed.<br><br>\ud83d\udd11 Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Couch Co-op</strong>: Play locally or via <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crate-Loads of Levels</strong>: From smooth operations to total catastrophe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Certified Chaos</strong>: Drift, crash, launch, and occasionally deliver crates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Achievements</strong>: Track your progress through the game and be rewarded.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Big Brain Move","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3628890/de4d3c1b7428574860e1b346d85bf4417370b440.jpg"},{"name":"Found the entrance to the first level.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3628890/02115b4655ae45ef9ff6e8474fa2d2f2b7e6cd72.jpg"},{"name":"Sat through training.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3628890/098364f04e9aaffeb6c6cfcecc4aa27ad7e8acb8.jpg"},{"name":"Worked out the controls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3628890/79f6315a4ca25078d4244acd88ed54aab4a6c4a9